{"id":"lamento","lemma":"lamento","pos":"noun","rank":507,"glosses":["lament","plaint","wail, wailing"],"ipa":"/laˈmento/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"lamentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-lamento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Lamento que te sientas así.","en":"I'm sorry you feel that way.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/515058","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to seat","l":"sentar"},{"g":"like this"}]},{"text":"Estoy cansado de tus lamentos.","en":"I'm tired of your whining.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803714","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"tired, weary, wearied"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]},{"text":"Lamento que no hayas podido venir con nosotros.","en":"I'm sorry that you couldn't come with us.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/609867","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"beech, beech tree","l":"haya"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to come"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"we"}]},{"text":"Lo lamento tanto.","en":"I'm so sorry.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438073","words":[{"g":"it / him"},null,{"g":"copy"}]},{"text":"Estamos hasta las narices de tus lamentos.","en":"We're fed up with your complaining.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/611736","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"until"},{"g":"the / them"},{"g":"nose","l":"nariz"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"your"},null]}]}